WEBVTT

00:06:29.427 --> 00:06:31.554
they want to see their money
put to good use.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.722
Take the Quality Jobs Fund, for example.

00:06:34.014 --> 00:06:35.516
It’s a collaborative effort

00:06:35.516 --> 00:06:38.269
between the Federal
Home Loan Bank of San Francisco

00:06:38.269 --> 00:06:40.563
and the New World Foundation,

00:06:40.563 --> 00:06:45.317
and their express mission
is to address inequality

00:06:45.317 --> 00:06:47.862
through quality jobs expansion
and skills development.

00:06:49.071 --> 00:06:54.368
We apply for allocations or grants
from philanthropies like those,

00:06:54.368 --> 00:06:57.288
work with the government dollars
that we just described,

00:06:57.288 --> 00:06:59.874
and companies in the way
that we just talked about,

00:06:59.874 --> 00:07:03.377
put it all together
to use it to pay people to learn.